### Letta Agent SDK

This should replace all legacy direct Letta REST implementation in Moltwork. It supports local, cloud and remote backends; local requires Node 22.19+ and uses an SDK-managed App Server. ([GitHub][1])

[https://github.com/letta-ai/letta-agent-sdk](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta-agent-sdk?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

[https://www.letta.com/agent-sdk/](https://www.letta.com/agent-sdk/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

The WorkerKit adapter should talk only to your `runtime-letta` service. If Letta changes internals later, only that service changes.

