Paper:

[https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.01885](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.01885?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

ACL 2026:

[https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.981/](https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.981/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

